INSERT INTO kb_sign_on_house (sign, house_number, summary, approach) VALUES
-- Aries on houses 1-12
('Aries', 1, 'You lead with boldness and direct energy. People see you as someone who acts first and asks questions later, with infectious confidence in your own abilities. You''re the initiator in any group.', 'You approach life by charging forward and testing boundaries. You trust your gut instinct and aren''t afraid to be first, even when it''s uncomfortable. Self-assertion comes naturally to you.'),
('Aries', 2, 'You''re entrepreneurial with money and willing to take financial risks that others won''t. Your earning potential is strong, but you can be impulsive with spending. You value independence in your finances.', 'You build wealth through action and initiative, not by waiting for opportunities. You''re direct about money matters and don''t shy away from advocating for higher pay or pursuing new income streams.'),
('Aries', 3, 'Your communication style is direct, quick, and sometimes blunt. You speak your mind without much filtering and debate energizes you. You''re drawn to competitive or stimulating conversations.', 'You learn fast and retain information through doing, not just studying. You engage with siblings and peers as friendly rivals, always ready for a verbal sparring match or shared adventure.'),
('Aries', 4, 'You approach home as a base camp for your adventures, not a retreat. Your family environment likely included strong personalities or competition. You may clash with tradition or inherited family patterns.', 'You create home through action and independence. You''re willing to renovate, move, or shake things up domestically. Family stability matters less to you than personal freedom.'),
('Aries', 5, 'Your creative expression is bold and unfiltered. Romance is exciting and passionate for you, though you can burn through relationships quickly. Children benefit from your courage and encouragement to be themselves.', 'You pursue creative projects with energy and enthusiasm, often without a detailed plan. You love the thrill of new romantic connections and aren''t afraid to take the lead in love.'),
('Aries', 6, 'You have high physical energy and metabolism, but can run yourself ragged. Your health thrives on competition or high-intensity activity. Your work style is fast-paced and results-driven.', 'You approach daily tasks with urgency and don''t like slow, methodical routines. You need physical outlets and variety in your work to stay engaged. Rest doesn''t come naturally to you.'),
('Aries', 7, 'You attract and are attracted to partners who challenge you. Relationships with you are dynamic and passionate, though you may struggle with compromise. You need a partner who can match your energy and independence.', 'You approach partnership by being fully yourself and expecting the same from your partner. You''re direct about your needs and don''t play games. Equality and mutual respect matter deeply.'),
('Aries', 8, 'You handle other people''s resources boldly and aren''t squeamish about shared finances or inheritances. Transformation fascinates you, and you''re willing to dive into psychological depths. Sexuality is straightforward and unashamed for you.', 'You approach shared resources with confidence and initiative. You''re comfortable discussing money, debt, and sensitive matters directly. You see transformation as an exciting challenge, not a threat.'),
('Aries', 9, 'You approach philosophy and learning as a challenge to master. You''re drawn to bold ideas and aren''t afraid to question established beliefs. Travel excites you most when it involves adventure or discovery.', 'You learn by doing and testing ideas in real situations. You have strong opinions about morality and meaning. Higher education works best when it''s competitive or action-oriented.'),
('Aries', 10, 'You''re driven to achieve recognition and climb the ladder quickly. Your career needs to match your ambition and allow for leadership. You make bold career moves that others consider risky.', 'You approach career by taking charge and creating opportunities yourself. You''re comfortable with visibility and willing to fight for your position. Status and achievement matter to you.'),
('Aries', 11, 'You''re active in your community but sometimes as a provocateur or challenger. You attract ambitious friends who share your drive. Groups benefit from your enthusiasm and willingness to start new initiatives.', 'You approach friendships and communities as spaces for growth and healthy competition. You''re the person initiating group activities or pushing the collective toward bold action.'),
('Aries', 12, 'You have unconscious anger or frustration that needs healthy outlets. Your spirituality is practical and direct, not abstract. You may suppress vulnerability beneath a confident exterior.', 'You approach spirituality as a practice that requires discipline and honesty. Your hidden strength lies in your capacity for courage and renewal. Meditation works best when paired with physical movement.'),

-- Taurus on houses 1-12
('Taurus', 1, 'You project calm, grounded presence that people find reassuring. You move through the world at your own pace without apology. You''re dependable and naturally attract trust from others.', 'You approach life by building solid foundations and moving steadily forward. You don''t rush decisions and trust your instincts about people and situations. Consistency is your superpower.'),
('Taurus', 2, 'You''re naturally good at accumulating wealth through steady effort. You''re careful with money and think long-term about finances. Your values are deeply tied to security and comfort.', 'You build wealth slowly and deliberately, avoiding get-rich-quick schemes. You invest wisely and don''t spend impulsively. Financial security is non-negotiable for your peace of mind.'),
('Taurus', 3, 'Your communication style is thoughtful and measured. You don''t talk much, but when you do, people listen. You need time to think before responding and dislike being rushed.', 'You learn thoroughly and retain information reliably. You prefer written communication to verbal. You''re patient with siblings and appreciate deep, stable relationships with people in your immediate circle.'),
('Taurus', 4, 'Home is sacred to you—a place of comfort and stability. You likely grew up with strong family values around property and permanence. You invest heavily in making your living space beautiful and inviting.', 'You approach home-building as a long-term project. You''re willing to spend money on quality furnishings and maintenance. Family traditions matter to you, and you''re the keeper of family memory.'),
('Taurus', 5, 'Your creative expression is sensual and tactile—you''re drawn to working with materials. Romance is deep and committed for you; you''re not interested in casual flings. Children benefit from your stability and patience.', 'You pursue creative projects with patience, willing to spend time mastering your craft. You fall in love slowly but completely. You create a nurturing, comfortable environment for those you love.'),
('Taurus', 6, 'Your body is naturally strong and reliable, though you can struggle with sluggishness. You heal well but need consistency in health routines. Your work style is steady and thorough.', 'You approach daily habits by building sustainable routines. You need physical work that engages your senses. Health and wellness matter to you as investments in long-term wellbeing.'),
('Taurus', 7, 'You seek stable, lasting partnerships. You''re loyal once committed and don''t take relationships lightly. Your partner needs to match your values around home, family, and security.', 'You approach partnership as a lifelong commitment. You''re reliable and steady, though you can be stubborn. You need physical affection and tangible expressions of love.'),
('Taurus', 8, 'You handle shared resources conservatively and with careful management. You''re comfortable with inheritances and other people''s money, as long as it''s managed wisely. Transformation happens slowly for you.', 'You approach shared finances with caution and pragmatism. You''re willing to explore depth and psychology, but at your own pace. Sexuality is physical and straightforward for you.'),
('Taurus', 9, 'You approach philosophy practically, wanting real-world applications. Travel appeals to you when it''s comfortable and allows time to savor experiences. Higher learning works best through hands-on or experiential methods.', 'You develop your beliefs slowly and stick with them. You''re interested in philosophy that helps you live better, not abstract theory. You travel to experience comfort and beauty in different places.'),
('Taurus', 10, 'Your career path is steady and builds security over time. You''re not flashy or attention-seeking, but you''re reliable and climb the ladder consistently. You''re excellent in roles requiring patience and follow-through.', 'You approach career as a long-term investment in security. You build expertise slowly and become invaluable in your role. Stability and fair compensation matter more than rapid advancement.'),
('Taurus', 11, 'You''re loyal to your communities and friend groups, serving as the stabilizing presence. You prefer small, close groups to large networks. You''re slow to open up but deeply committed once you do.', 'You approach friendship and community as lasting bonds. You''re the person people rely on for consistent support. You contribute practically and expect the same in return.'),
('Taurus', 12, 'Your unconscious groundedness is your hidden strength. Your spirituality is practical and tied to the physical world. You may suppress sensuality or needs for comfort beneath a stoic exterior.', 'You approach spirituality through nature and physical practice. Your hidden power lies in your ability to find peace and acceptance. Meditation works best in peaceful natural settings.'),

-- Gemini on houses 1-12
('Gemini', 1, 'You present as curious, youthful, and adaptable. People see you as someone who knows a little about everything and loves to talk. You''re perceived as intelligent and communicative.', 'You approach life by gathering information and exploring multiple perspectives. You''re flexible and uncomfortable with rigid structures. Your mind is always working, connecting ideas, and asking questions.'),
('Gemini', 2, 'You earn money through communication, writing, or trading. Your finances are fluid and you''re comfortable with multiple income streams. You may struggle with consistency in money management.', 'You approach earning as a mental game, always looking for clever angles. You''re good at negotiating and can talk your way into opportunities. Keeping track of details matters less to you than seeing the big picture.'),
('Gemini', 3, 'You''re the communicator of your family—quick-witted and talkative. You likely have lots of siblings or sibling-like relationships. Your words are sharp and you can debate anyone on any topic.', 'You learn rapidly and retain information through discussion and variety. You connect with others through conversation and shared information. Your neighborhood and immediate surroundings fascinate you endlessly.'),
('Gemini', 4, 'Your home is a hub of activity and conversation. You grew up in an intellectual or verbally stimulating family environment. You may move frequently or have multiple "home bases."', 'You approach home as a space for connection and mental stimulation. You fill your home with books, technology, and conversation. Family bonds center around communication and shared ideas.'),
('Gemini', 5, 'Your creativity flows through words, ideas, and playful expression. Romance is cerebral for you—you fall for minds first. Children benefit from your curiosity and willingness to explain how things work.', 'You pursue creative projects with intellectual excitement and variety. You enjoy flirtation and mental sparring as much as physical connection. You stay playful and young in heart.'),
('Gemini', 6, 'Your nervous system can be your weakness; you''re prone to overthinking and scattered energy. You need variety in your daily work to stay engaged. Your health improves with mental stimulation and social connection.', 'You approach daily tasks by multitasking and jumping between projects. You need work that keeps your mind engaged. Physical health takes a backseat to mental stimulation.'),
('Gemini', 7, 'You''re drawn to partners who are intelligent and communicative. Relationship satisfaction depends on mental connection and conversation. You may struggle with emotional depth or commitment.', 'You approach partnership as a meeting of minds first. You need partners who can discuss ideas with you and keep things interesting. Boredom is your biggest relationship risk.'),
('Gemini', 8, 'You handle shared resources with flexibility but may overlook important details. You''re comfortable discussing taboo topics and other people''s money. Transformation fascinates you intellectually.', 'You approach shared finances by understanding the mechanics but not necessarily following through methodically. You''re curious about sexuality and psychology. You process deep emotions through conversation.'),
('Gemini', 9, 'You''re a natural student who loves learning for its own sake. Travel appeals to you as a way to gather experiences and stories. You may have strong opinions about beliefs but change them when presented with new information.', 'You approach higher learning with genuine curiosity and breadth rather than depth. You travel to see new places and meet new people. Philosophy interests you as long as it''s discussed actively.'),
('Gemini', 10, 'Your career likely involves communication, writing, trading, or movement. You excel in roles requiring adaptability and quick thinking. You may change careers frequently as your interests shift.', 'You approach career by leveraging your communication skills and adaptability. You''re excellent at networking and connecting people. You need variety to stay motivated.'),
('Gemini', 11, 'You''re active in your networks and communities, often as a connector. You know many people but may have few truly close friends. You enjoy group activities that involve conversation and exchange of ideas.', 'You approach community through networking and information-sharing. You''re the person who knows everyone and brings people together. You contribute ideas and connections.'),
('Gemini', 12, 'Your unconscious mind is restless and active. Your spirituality involves questioning and learning. You may overthink spiritual matters or struggle with sitting still.', 'You approach spirituality intellectually, wanting to understand its mechanics. Your hidden gift is your ability to communicate and connect. Meditation challenges you but helps calm your racing mind.'),

-- Cancer on houses 1-12
('Cancer', 1, 'You appear soft and approachable but have a protective shell underneath. People sense your emotional depth and sensitivity. You seem like someone who cares deeply about others.', 'You approach life by protecting what matters and building security. You''re intuitive about others'' needs and lead with empathy. Your emotions are your compass, though you don''t always show them.'),
('Cancer', 2, 'You earn money to create security and comfort for yourself and family. You may hold onto money or possessions for emotional reasons. Your relationship with money is tied to emotional safety.', 'You approach earning as a way to build the nest you need. You''re careful with money and think about long-term security. Spending can be emotional—you spend more when stressed or insecure.'),
('Cancer', 3, 'Your communication is emotional and you''re naturally empathetic to others'' feelings. You''re protective of family members and may have unresolved relationships with siblings. You''re sentimental about memories and family history.', 'You learn best through emotional connection and storytelling. You remember everything people tell you. Your communication centers on feelings and creating closer bonds with others.'),
('Cancer', 4, 'Home and family are your foundation and emotional center. You grew up with strong family ties and likely maintain close family connections. Your physical home is crucial to your sense of security.', 'You approach home-building as creating emotional sanctuary. You''re the family member who keeps everyone connected. Your home reflects your emotional inner world and offers comfort.'),
('Cancer', 5, 'Your creativity flows from emotion and intuition. Romance is deeply emotional for you—you seek emotional safety alongside attraction. You''re a natural nurturing parent, though you may be protective to the point of limitation.', 'You pursue creative projects with emotional investment. You fall in love with the whole person, not just the surface. You create a nurturing, emotionally safe environment for loved ones.'),
('Cancer', 6, 'Your health is deeply affected by your emotional state. You''re intuitive about your body''s needs. Your work environment needs to feel emotionally safe and supportive.', 'You approach daily health by listening to your emotions and body. You need work that feels meaningful and supportive. Stress manifests in physical symptoms for you.'),
('Cancer', 7, 'You seek emotional safety and deep commitment in partnerships. You''re loyal and devoted to partners, sometimes to your own detriment. You need reassurance and consistent emotional connection.', 'You approach partnership with your whole heart and expect reciprocal commitment. You''re attentive to your partner''s emotional needs. You struggle to leave relationships, even unhealthy ones.'),
('Cancer', 8, 'You''re deeply intuitive about others'' resources and emotional undercurrents. Shared finances feel intimate to you. Transformation is emotional and can trigger your protective instincts.', 'You approach shared resources with caution and emotional consideration. You''re sensitive to power dynamics in financial arrangements. Sexuality is emotional and tied to feeling safe with your partner.'),
('Cancer', 9, 'Your beliefs center on family, tradition, and emotional wisdom. Travel appeals to you when it''s with people you''re close to. Higher learning works best in supportive environments.', 'You approach philosophy through the lens of family and tradition. You value teachers who care about your development. Travel is better with loved ones than alone.'),
('Cancer', 10, 'Your career path is guided by emotional security needs. You''re drawn to work that helps others or protects the vulnerable. You need to feel your work matters on a human level.', 'You approach career as a way to support yourself and family. You''re loyal to employers and invested in workplace relationships. Recognition and stability matter more than prestige.'),
('Cancer', 11, 'You''re protective and nurturing within your communities. You attract people who need support or care. Your friendships are few but deep and lasting.', 'You approach community as family—you''re invested in others'' wellbeing. You''re the caretaker of your friend group. You commit emotionally and expect loyalty in return.'),
('Cancer', 12, 'Your unconscious is rich with emotion and intuition. Your spirituality is deeply personal and tied to emotional healing. You may struggle with emotional patterns you inherited.', 'You approach spirituality through healing and connecting with deeper self. Your hidden gift is your intuitive wisdom. You''re drawn to practices that soothe and nurture your sensitive soul.'),

