('Leo', 8, 'You''re magnanimous with shared resources and generous to those you love. You''re passionate and intense in intimate relationships. Transformation doesn''t scare you—you embrace rebirth with drama.', 'You approach shared finances with generosity and confidence. You''re comfortable with intimacy and sexuality. You face transformation with courage and creativity.'),
