('Sagittarius', 5, 'Your creativity is expansive and philosophical. Romance is an adventure and an awakening for you. You''re a parent who encourages your children to explore and grow.', 'You pursue creative projects with enthusiasm and big vision. You fall in love with ideas and possibilities as much as people. You create an adventurous, open-minded environment for loved ones.'),
('Sagittarius', 6, 'Your energy is high and your optimism protects your health. You need variety in your daily work and physical movement. Your work is best when it has a larger purpose.', 'You approach health through activity and positive thinking. You need work that feels meaningful or involves growth. Monotony brings you down physically and emotionally.'),
('Sagittarius', 7, 'You seek partners who share your adventurous spirit and philosophical interests. You''re drawn to exploration and growth in relationships. You may struggle with commitment or settling down.', 'You approach partnership as a shared adventure and exploration. You need partners who support your growth and freedom. Feeling trapped is your biggest relationship killer.'),
('Sagittarius', 8, 'You handle shared resources with optimism and expansiveness. You''re interested in exploring psychological and sexual depths. Transformation excites you.', 'You approach shared finances with confidence and generosity. You''re comfortable discussing intimate matters openly. You embrace transformation as growth.'),
('Sagittarius', 9, 'Your beliefs are developed through exploration and study. Travel is a spiritual practice for you. Higher learning excites you and shapes your worldview.', 'You approach philosophy as an ongoing exploration. You travel to learn and expand your perspective. Education is central to your identity.'),
('Sagittarius', 10, 'Your career path involves travel, teaching, or expansion. You''re drawn to work that has meaning beyond just earning. You may change careers in pursuit of growth.', 'You approach career as a vehicle for growth and meaning. You''re willing to risk stability for growth opportunities. Purpose matters more than security.'),
('Sagittarius', 11, 'You''re active in multiple communities and friend groups. You attract people who share your enthusiasm and optimism. You contribute ideas and vision.', 'You approach community with infectious optimism. You''re the person organizing group adventures. You bring people together around shared vision.'),
('Sagittarius', 12, 'Your unconscious is optimistic and expansive. Your spirituality is philosophical and inclusive. You may struggle with recklessness or spiritual bypassing.', 'You approach spirituality through exploration and faith. Your hidden gift is your ability to inspire and broaden perspectives. You''re called to share wisdom and vision.'),

-- Capricorn on houses 1-12
('Capricorn', 1, 'You appear serious, competent, and responsible. People perceive you as someone who gets things done. You seem like a natural authority figure.', 'You approach life with discipline and long-term thinking. You''re willing to delay gratification for real achievement. Your integrity and reliability are your foundations.'),
('Capricorn', 2, 'You''re disciplined about money and focused on building wealth. You earn through hard work and strategic investment. You''re excellent at long-term financial planning.', 'You approach earning with patience and strategic thinking. You''re willing to work hard and delay instant gratification. Wealth accumulation is a long-term project you''re committed to.'),
('Capricorn', 3, 'Your communication is measured, professional, and grounded. You don''t waste words and expect the same from others. You likely had serious or demanding family communication.', 'You learn through focused study and practical application. You communicate with clarity and authority. You''re interested in information that helps you achieve goals.'),
('Capricorn', 4, 'Your home is structured and functions as your base of operations. You grew up with expectations around responsibility and duty. Family tradition and lineage matter to you.', 'You approach home as an investment and foundation. You maintain it carefully and invest in quality. Family legacy is important to your sense of identity.'),
('Capricorn', 5, 'Your creativity is disciplined and focused on lasting work. Romance develops slowly but becomes committed and serious. You''re a parent who takes your responsibilities seriously.', 'You pursue creative projects with discipline and long-term vision. You love deeply but express it through commitment and reliability. You create a stable, secure environment for loved ones.'),
('Capricorn', 6, 'Your health requires discipline and structure. You''re willing to commit to exercise and health routines long-term. Your work is where you build reputation and achieve.', 'You approach health with discipline and patience. You benefit from structure and clear expectations. Work is where you gain status and accomplish meaningful things.'),
('Capricorn', 7, 'You seek partners who are responsible and share your values around commitment. You approach partnerships as serious, long-term commitments. You''re loyal and expect the same.', 'You approach partnership with commitment and seriousness. You''re not interested in casual romance. You need partners who respect your ambitions and share your values.'),
('Capricorn', 8, 'You handle shared resources with discipline and conservative strategy. You understand power dynamics in shared finances. Transformation happens slowly through mature understanding.', 'You approach shared finances strategically and transparently. You''re comfortable with authority and power in relationships. You process emotions through understanding and responsibility.'),
('Capricorn', 9, 'Your beliefs are traditional and earned through life experience. Travel appeals to you when it serves a practical purpose. Higher learning is an investment in future success.', 'You approach philosophy with respect for tradition and wisdom. You travel strategically. Education is valuable as it serves your long-term goals.'),
('Capricorn', 10, 'Your career path is your primary identity. You''re driven by ambition and status. You''re excellent at leadership and building institutions.', 'You approach career with total commitment and long-term strategy. You''re willing to do hard work for advancement. Status and achievement are central to your identity.'),
('Capricorn', 11, 'You''re a steady, reliable presence in your communities. You take leadership roles seriously. You contribute through structure and strategic thinking.', 'You approach community with seriousness and commitment. You''re the person who builds lasting institutions. You contribute through leadership and responsibility.'),
('Capricorn', 12, 'Your unconscious is disciplined and structured. Your spirituality is traditional and grounded. You may struggle with rigid expectations or emotional reserve.', 'You approach spirituality with discipline and respect for tradition. Your hidden gift is your ability to build lasting structures. You''re called to mature and lead with wisdom.'),

-- Aquarius on houses 1-12
('Aquarius', 1, 'You appear intellectual, unique, and slightly detached. People perceive you as progressive and individualistic. You seem like someone who thinks differently from the crowd.', 'You approach life from an intellectual and independent perspective. You''re drawn to ideas that challenge convention. Your originality and detachment are your strengths.'),
('Aquarius', 2, 'You''re independent with money and may have unconventional income sources. You''re open to new financial technologies and approaches. You may struggle with inconsistent earning.', 'You approach earning in non-traditional ways. You''re drawn to innovative financial strategies. Money feels less personal to you than to most people.'),
('Aquarius', 3, 'Your communication is intellectual and unconventional. You''re interested in ideas that challenge the status quo. You likely felt different in your family.', 'You learn through intellectual exploration and outside-the-box thinking. You communicate ideas with detachment and objectivity. You''re interested in what others haven''t thought of yet.'),
('Aquarius', 4, 'Your home is a reflection of your unique ideas and interests. You grew up feeling different or not fitting family norms. Your home is filled with technology or unconventional choices.', 'You approach home as an intellectual space rather than emotional center. You fill it with technology and unique design. Family feels secondary to your own path.'),
('Aquarius', 5, 'Your creativity is innovative and intellectually driven. Romance is secondary to friendship and intellectual connection. You''re a parent who encourages your children''s individuality.', 'You pursue creative projects with original thinking. You fall in love with minds and shared ideas. You create a free-thinking environment for loved ones.'),
('Aquarius', 6, 'Your health is affected by stress and disconnection from your body. You need intellectual stimulation in your daily work. You''re drawn to innovative health approaches.', 'You approach health intellectually, researching the best methods. You need work that feels innovative or idealistic. Mind matters more than body for you.'),
('Aquarius', 7, 'You seek partners who are intellectual equals and respect your independence. You need plenty of freedom and personal space. You may struggle with emotional intimacy.', 'You approach partnership with friendship as the foundation. You''re committed but detached, which can confuse partners. You need partners who understand your need for independence.'),
('Aquarius', 8, 'You handle shared resources with intellectual detachment. You''re comfortable with modern financial technologies. Transformation is processed intellectually.', 'You approach shared finances objectively and fairly. You''re comfortable with unconventional arrangements. Sexuality is secondary to intellectual connection.'),
('Aquarius', 9, 'Your beliefs are unconventional and developed through intellectual exploration. Travel appeals to you as intellectual adventure. Higher learning shapes your worldview.', 'You approach philosophy by questioning conventions. You travel to understand different cultures and ideas. Higher education is valuable for expanding perspective.'),
('Aquarius', 10, 'Your career involves innovation, technology, or idealistic work. You''re drawn to careers that feel revolutionary or progressive. You struggle in traditional hierarchies.', 'You approach career with focus on innovation and progress. You''re excellent in roles requiring original thinking. Traditional success matters less than feeling you''re advancing change.'),
('Aquarius', 11, 'You''re active in communities aligned with your ideals. You''re drawn to groups working toward progressive change. Friendships center on shared values and ideas.', 'You approach community through shared ideals and causes. You contribute ideas and intellectual energy. You''re drawn to people who think differently.'),
('Aquarius', 12, 'Your unconscious is innovative and future-oriented. Your spirituality is intellectual and unconventional. You may struggle with emotional disconnection or aloofness.', 'You approach spirituality intellectually and experimentally. Your hidden gift is your ability to see ahead. You''re called to bring new ideas and progress.'),

-- Pisces on houses 1-12
('Pisces', 1, 'You appear soft, empathetic, and otherworldly. People perceive you as artistic and intuitive. You seem like someone operating on a different wavelength.', 'You approach life intuitively and with compassion. You''re porous to others'' emotions and the world around you. Your sensitivity is both gift and vulnerability.'),
('Pisces', 2, 'You''re indirect with money and may struggle with financial reality. You earn through creative or service work. Money feels slippery and abstract to you.', 'You approach earning as something that should happen naturally. You''re not comfortable with aggressive financial management. Money feels less important than other things.'),
('Pisces', 3, 'Your communication is intuitive and often non-verbal. You struggle to articulate what you sense. You may have had confusing or unclear communication in your family.', 'You learn through intuition and immersion rather than structured study. You communicate through art, music, or metaphor. You''re interested in what lies beneath words.'),
('Pisces', 4, 'Your home is a sanctuary where you retreat from the world. You grew up in a family where emotions were diffused or unclear. Your home reflects your inner emotional world.', 'You approach home as a spiritual retreat. You fill it with art, music, and beauty. Family bonds are emotional but sometimes unclear.'),
('Pisces', 5, 'Your creativity is your spiritual practice and healing. Romance is idealized and escapist for you. You''re a compassionate parent who loves unconditionally.', 'You pursue creative projects as spiritual expression. You fall in love with the idea of love and the whole person merged together. You create a magical, loving environment for loved ones.'),
('Pisces', 6, 'Your health is deeply affected by your emotional and spiritual state. You''re intuitive about healing but struggle with practical health routines. Your work should feel meaningful or you''ll struggle.', 'You approach health holistically and spiritually. You need work that feels purposeful and meaningful. Stress manifests as physical illness for you.'),
('Pisces', 7, 'You seek partners who understand your sensitive, intuitive nature. You''re compassionate and sometimes lose yourself in relationships. You need partners who ground you.', 'You approach partnership with compassion and devotion. You''re sensitive to your partner''s needs. You can absorb too much of your partner''s emotions.'),
('Pisces', 8, 'You''re intuitive about other people''s resources and secrets. Shared finances feel murky to you. Transformation is mystical and spiritual.', 'You approach shared finances with intuition rather than strategy. You''re uncomfortable with direct discussions about money. Sexuality is spiritual and merged with love.'),
('Pisces', 9, 'Your beliefs are spiritual and intuitive. Travel is a spiritual journey for you. Higher learning feels abstract—you prefer wisdom to information.', 'You approach philosophy spiritually and intuitively. You travel for spiritual development and inspiration. Learning feels less important than wisdom and understanding.'),
('Pisces', 10, 'Your career involves creativity, healing, or spiritual work. You need work that feels meaningful at a soul level. You struggle in hard, competitive environments.', 'You approach career as service or creative expression. You''re excellent in healing or artistic fields. Meaning matters more than success or status.'),
('Pisces', 11, 'You''re drawn to communities aligned with healing or spiritual values. You''re compassionate toward your friend group. You can get lost in group dynamics.', 'You approach community with compassion and idealism. You''re the person who cares about everyone''s wellbeing. You give too much sometimes.'),
('Pisces', 12, 'Your unconscious is rich and mystical. Your spirituality is your native language. You may struggle with boundaries or escapism.', 'You approach spirituality naturally and deeply. Your hidden gift is your connection to the divine. You''re called to heal, create, and transcend.');
